{"meta":{"id":"tt24053860","type":"series","name":"El Chacal","imdb_id":"tt24053860","description":"El Chacal, un escurridizo y solitario asesino sin rival, se gana la vida trabajando para el mejor postor. Sin embargo, tras su último asesinato, su camino se cruza con el de una tenaz agente de inteligencia británica que empieza a seguirle la pista en una emocionante persecución a través de Europa, dejando un rastro de destrucción a su paso.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt24053860.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/enVrO8TRkdT8dmYXTfI4sEjR5Kp.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rGdW2LRbsHkwmWN2u9iol18ZN95.png","genres":["Drama","Action & Adventure","Misterio"],"releaseInfo":"2024-","released":"2024-11-07T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Returning Series","imdbRating":"8.1","country":"United Kingdom","cast":["Eddie Redmayne","Lashana Lynch","Eleanor Matsuura","Chukwudi Iwuji","Úrsula Corberó","Adoney Díaz Barajas","Rajko Radovic"],"writer":["Ronan Bennett","Frederick Forsyth"],"trailers":[{"source":"Zr-T9Ju92bQ","type":"Trailer","name":"Tráiler oficial (VOSE)","ytId":"Zr-T9Ju92bQ","lang":"es"},{"source":"EUb_04MdnMI","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer","ytId":"EUb_04MdnMI","lang":"en"},{"source":"qXJ2HKqFbE0","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Teaser Trailer","ytId":"qXJ2HKqFbE0","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"Zr-T9Ju92bQ","title":"Tráiler oficial (VOSE)"},{"ytId":"EUb_04MdnMI","title":"Official Trailer"},{"ytId":"qXJ2HKqFbE0","title":"Official Teaser Trailer"}],"links":[{"name":"8.1","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt24053860"},{"name":"Drama","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Drama"},{"name":"Action & Adventure","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Action+%26+Adventure"},{"name":"Misterio","category":"